<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tasalonikayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo Au Pɛsi beenɛ Yɛnɛ Shɔ Tasalonikayi bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tasalonikayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo Au Pɛsi Beenɛ Yɛnɛ Shɔ Tasalonikayi bi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Si shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a tipi Tasalonika i sisɨn ɓɛɛ jo ɗɔ dunɛ yɛnɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn aru vimatinɛ ayuu Kirisi sɔɔnɛni. Bulus Sẽkoo Au Pɛsi Beenɛ Yɛnɛ Shɔ Tasalonikayi bi, sha ɓɛɛ jo ruu sisɨn ãnɛ nɛ Uɓeyelapa lee sɔɔnɛ atɛ gboti. Bulus tɔ̃ri ruum kati, a shanɛ Kirisi ɓɛɛ sɔɔnɛ, vikɔ̃linɛ a lanɛ i yɛ shapɛtɔ waanɛ a shɔlanɛm au sãyɛ nɔsisɨn, a shɔ ɓaunɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpati Shɔlanɛ,&gt;&gt;Shɔgbete yɛ ɔ̃ Kirisi shɔnɔpɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="ipi">Jashonɛu ã kaka a geli shɔ ai yɛ ɓalilaam, nɛyi ɔ̃ atette sisɨn ãnɛ ikɔ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ ɗɔnya a raaɓoonɛ, nɛi pɛli vishonɛ aru i kpaa vishaanɛ naa Bulus au ɓɛusa vishonɛ i pɛliyɛ, i ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨmɛɛnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛlinɛ a nyarisinɛ (1.3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyakonɛ ayuu Kirisi anɛ (2.1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bimasinɛ aru Kirisayi vishonɛ (3.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyayisinɛ (3.16-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />N kɔ Bulus n bee Sẽkoom yɛnɛ ɔ ɗɔbii. Sila a Timotini i a nyazɔ a nkɔni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">U dɔ̃ sẽkoom yɛnɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a koomo Tasalonika i ɗɔbii, shɔ gbeteyi pɛ Ɗalapa Uɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi ɓɛɛyɛ:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa Uɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisini i ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruuyeenɛ a Kirisi anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />U shɔbiiyi ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ kopiɗaviya awɔ yuu. Pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng u pɛlitɔ nankɔ aruviya ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a ɗɔ banɛ fɛ̃ɛm, a ɔrinɛ gbete kopiya awuni a zɔ yuu aɗɔ ɗekɨn fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Aruukɔ u au yuu u baasitɛ awɔ yuuni u geli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗalapa bi kopiɗɔpiya. U baasi aru ɔ ɗekɨn yɛnɛ a sisɨnmɛɛnɛ a sisɨn ãnɛ a raatasinɛ a raaɓoonɛ gbete kpaayɛni kpai.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Vim kpai tasitɛ nɛ Ɗalapa yeeruu pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, aruumkɔ shɔ yɛ gaa wɔ atette shɔ gbete i kpaa tonɛtɔ a Ɗa ɗɔ kpati roonɛni, gbete ɔ ɓooraa au yuunimi. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ɗalapa yɛ pɛli vigbete tɔ̃vɨn yɛtɔ: yɛ pɔ̃ shɔ gbeteyi pɔ̃wɔ raaɓoonɛ i ɓooraatɔ, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />ama yɛ ãwɔ susunɛtɔ shɔ gbeteyi ɓooraayɛ a ukɔni. Yɛ pɛli vim aɗagbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kɛ shɛnɛ a kolapa au Ɗajashonɛlapa pɛ̃nibayini, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Yɛ pɛlivishonɛ a yaa gbete a ɗɔɔ shaanɛ, u tasi gbeteyi bɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗalapa nyagɨnnɛ raarɛ, a shɔ gbete i ji gɨn ruu tɔ̃vɨn ɓa ayuu Uɓeyelapa Yesɔni ɓa. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />I yɛ ɓooraa lɛsinɛ gbete yisinya ɓayɛ dangdang, shɔ yɛ sẽyitɔ a Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn au bassinɛ kakani, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />A leegbete kaanɛ aru u shɔbiiyi bassiutɔ a bassinɛ gbete shɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi naa kpai, a yɛ ɔ̃ ji ai tetteni, aruviya ɔ ãsisɨntɛ a ruu gbete u gelɔɔyɛni.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Aruukɔ u gaki wɔ Ɗalapa tɔ kopiɗaviya, u gaki wɔ Ɗalapa u pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ kpaa suru gbete ɓawɔnya au yuuniyɛtɔ. Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u kaka u sɔ̃rinya vigbete ɔ kasiyɛ tɔ̃vɨntɔ kpai, wɔsɔ̃n ɔ yisinya ɔ vishonɛ sisɨn ãnɛtɔ kpai. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />A nyabangkɔ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii yɛ kpaa basinɛtɔ awɔ yuuni, ɔkɔɔma ɔ kpaa sɔ̃njo au ɗɔbii, nɔgbete Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ ɔ̃yɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi ɓɛɛni.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔlanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Dɔdɔrim n shɔbiiyi n gakɔɔtɔ sãnɛ ayuu Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi anɛ au nyatolinɛ nyazɔ aru u kpaazɔ awuni, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />ɓanɛ ɔ sisɨn u ɓutitɔ wese tɛ̃ɛ̃ti ko ɔ sisɨn u lɛsi a vigbete shɔ shanɛ Uɓeyelapa lee sɔɔnɛ atɛ gboti. wɔɔɓa shɔwɔ shatɛ nankɔ a nya shanɛ suru, ko a Ɗaruubii nwanɛ, ko nɛu bee au sẽkoo. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mɔkaa yaa shɔwɔnɛ u ɗakarɛ ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya. Leeu yɛ a ɓa aruviya Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ ɓɛɛ anɛ setɛ shɔzɛ waanɛ i risi Ɗalapa kntitɛ, shɔlanɛm yɛ shɛrɛ, yɛ yɛkɛ wɛrɛ yaa. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Shɔlanɛm yɛ ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a ko-pi jaɗa shɔpiyani, ko vigbete shɔ basi yɛni piti kpai yɛ basiu yuu ai ɗekɨn, yɛ yɛrɛ u ɔ̃ a wɛrɛ Ɗa u tasiu yuu nɛnkɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ɔ ji kpaa sisɨn ɓayɛ? Aɗagbete n si ɔkɔɔni n gelɔɔ vimtɔ kpai. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Dɔdɔrim a zɛ vigbete zãri vimiyi pɛlinɛtɛ, yɛ shɛ aɗagbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Lanɛ ɓusinɛm u aɗɔgbete pɔ̃ shɔ, shɔ ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛ kalikali, ama shɔgbete shiri shɔ nɛ shɔ masinya ɓa a Ɗalapani ɓa, yɛ yɛ ɗekɨn a pɛlinɛni, setɛ Ɗalapa tuutɛ a nyabani. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Kɛɗɔn shɔlanɛm yɛ shɛkɛkɨn, ama naa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kaanɛ, yɛ nyouvɔrɔtɔ au ɔ̃kinɛ gbete shɛ au nyani, u lɛsiurɛ au kɔlinɛ gbete au ɗɔbiiyɛni. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Shɔlanɛm yɛ apɛ a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ kaka, u pɛlivishonɛ zɔng vibiizaanɛ nyayeelinɛyi a vinɔlusinɛyini kpai. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Yɛ pɛlivishonɛ a nyaba tottot u ɗaki shɔgbeteyi Ɗalapa yɛ lɛsiyɛ. I yɛ lɛsitɔ aruviya i bɛ̃ɛ̃ tɔ̃vɨn ɔrinɛtɔ, nɔgbeteyi isi kpaa raanɛyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Aruukɔ Ɗalapa sho nyaba niinɛ pɛ̃niba u pɛlivishonɛ ai tete nɔgbete i ãsisɨn a ruu nyayeenɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Aru nankɔ shɔgbeteyi ji ãsisɨn ɓa Ɗalapa biini ɓa ama ai ɔri ba ruuvini, i yɛ lɛsiyitɔ.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɔwɔtɛ ɔ kpaa raanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />N shɔbiiyi ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ kopiɗaviya awɔ yuuni, ɔ shɔgbete Uɓeyelapa ɔriyɛ. Aruviya Ɗalapa gaa ɔkɔɔ lɔɔnɛ a nyaba Ɗa suru aru ɔ kpaa raanɛ a pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ ɔ̃ u shɔbii wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi, ama awɔ nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nya a nyaba ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete u nwarɔɔyɛ; ɓawɔ nya nɛ ɔ kpaa bassinɛ gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi ãwɔyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Aruumkɔ n shɔbiiyi ɔ shiɗɔkaziti ayuu vitɔvɨng gbete u matɔɔyɛ, au nya gbete u nwarɔɔyɛ ko a sẽkoo au beeyɛ.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi au yuu a Ɗalapa u Ɓeye, shɔgbete ɔriu a ɔrinɛ gbete yisinya ɓayɛ au ɓusɨng tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ãu sisɨn lakinɛ, a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛni, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />u masɔɔbii u ãwɔ kaka kopiɗaviya ɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng ɔ sha vitɔ̃vɨng.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ Gakiu Ɗatɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Nyayisinɛ n shɔbiiyi, ɔ gakiu Ɗa tɔ nɛ Uɓeyelapa u ruubii u yɛ ɗekɨn u raaɗɔ mɛɛli, shɔ tɛ naa kazitini, ji nagbete si awɔ ateteyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ɔ gaki Ɗa nɛ Ɗalapa u raautɔ a shɔlanɛ a shɔ kɔ̃linɛyi naani; aruviya i ɓa piti kpai i ã sisɨnrɛ ɓa<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ama Uɓeyelapa u sisɨn ãnɛ aɗɔn, yɛ lakɔɔ kaka tɔ u kɔwɔrɛ a shɔ kɔ̃linɛn naani. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Uɓeyelapa masiu bi tɛttɔ awɔ yuuni, u zɛ tɛttɔ ɔ ɗɔ pɛlinɛ, ɔ yɛ yɛ ɗekɨntɔ a vigbete u gelɔɔ n-tɛ ɔ pɛliyɛni.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa u tɛɛsɔɔ ɗekɨn ɔ zɛ Ɗalapa ɔrinɛ fɛ̃ɛm a sisɨnmɛɛnɛ gbete Kirisi ãyɛnitɔ.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yushogɔ̃nɛ Aru Ɔ̃nɛ Weze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />U shɔbiiyi u ãsɔɔ nyatɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi nii, ɔ sẽbiikati a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ pũzɛyɛni kpai, a shɔgbeteyi gɨn nyakɔsinɛ gbete u ãyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ɔkɔɔ awɔ yuu ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ gɨn jo vigbete u pɛliyɛkɔ. U si ɓa pũzɛ ɓa aɗagbete u a ɔkɔɔniyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />U ji tɛ viwɔ jo a shɔwɔ naani au ji sho ɓani. Anɔgbete u si pɛli nam u pɛlivishonɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm; u pɛlivishonɛ zɨmba a niti ni aru ukɔu ɔ̃ri kopiya nɛ vikpɛtɛ kpɛtɛni. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />U pɛli vim ɓanɛ aru u nyaba gbete u kãu naapɔ̃sinɛ ɓa; u pɛlirɛ aru u ɔ̃kɛ vitasinɛ awɔ ɗɔbii ɔ gɨntɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Aɗagbete u si doo a ɔkɔɔni, u gelɔɔtɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete kɛ pɛli vishonɛ ɓa shɔkɔ yaau nɛ u shaa virɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />U sha vim aruviya shɔ gãsiyi awɔ tetteni gbete i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ pũzɛ i pɛli viwɔ ɓa see nya tosinɛ a shɔwɔyi vishonɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />A Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi nii u ãsi shɔmiyi nyatɛ, au gɔ̃yi yusho i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn ai pɛlivishonɛ fɛ̃ɛm aru i kpaa vigbeteyi shaayɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ama n shɔbiiyi ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔkɔɔ yɔɔnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛni. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Wɔ ɓa shɔwɔyi aɗɔn i yɛ gɨn ruu gbete u dɔ̃sɔɔ a sẽkoomni ɓa. Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn, ɔ kɨnnɔɔ a biini, ɔkɔɔ ɓasiyunɛ ikɔ ni, nɔgbete i ɓooyusẽ kn. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ama ɔkɔɔ pɛliyinɛ naa nɔpɔ̃yi; anɔgbete ɔ pɛli nam ɔ tɔ̃ritɔ naa mɛzɔ̃ ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyanwanɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa au yuu, shɔgbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɗɔgbete shɔ kpaa ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, u ãu ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ tɔ kopiɗaviya a ko-pi nyashɔpiya. Uɓeyelapa u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni kpai.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />N kɔn Bulus n bee nyageenɛm ang naa, shomkɔ nyaba gbete n pɔ̃naa a sẽkoom; shom nɔgbete n beeyɛkɔ.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni piti kpai.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>